 class="same"><div class="security"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/security/banks-dih-holdings-inc/">bdh</a></div><div class="closing">155</div></div></div></div><div class="item"><div class="stock"><div class="same"><div class="security"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/security/guyana-bank-for-trade-and-industry-limited/">bti</a></div><div class="closing">2500</div></div></div></div><div class="item"><div class="stock"><div class="same"><div class="security"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/security/citizens-bank-guyana-incorporated/">cbi</a></div><div class="closing">388</div></div></div></div><div class="item"><div class="stock"><div class="same"><div class="security"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/security/caribbean-container-incorporated/">cci</a></div><div class="closing">149</div></div></div></div><div class="item"><div class="stock"><div class="same"><div class="security"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/security/demerara-bank-limited/">dbl</a></div><div class="closing">279</div></div></div></div><div class="item"><div class="stock"><div class="negative"><div class="security"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/security/demerara-distillers-limited/">ddl</a></div><div class="closing">295</div><div class="change"><span>-</span>2 (0.67%)</div></div></div></div><div class="item"><div class="stock"><div class="same"><div class="security"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/security/demerara-tobacco-company-limited/">dtc</a></div><div class="closing">3000</div></div></div></div><div class="item"><div class="stock"><div class="same"><div class="security"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/security/guyana-stockfeeds-incorporated/">gsi</a></div><div class="closing">112</div></div></div></div><div class="item"><div class="stock"><div class="same"><div class="security"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/security/j-p-santos-company-limited/">jps</a></div><div class="closing">20</div></div></div></div><div class="item"><div class="stock"><div class="same"><div class="security"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/security/property-holdings-incorporated/">phi</a></div><div class="closing">14</div></div></div></div><div class="item"><div class="stock"><div class="negative"><div class="security"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/security/republic-bank-guyana-limited/">rbl</a></div><div class="closing">539.9</div><div class="change"><span>-</span>0.1 (0.02%)</div></div></div></div><div class="item"><div class="stock"><div class="same"><div class="security"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/security/rupununi-development-company-limited/">rdl</a></div><div class="closing">500</div></div></div></div><div class="item"><div class="stock"><div class="same"><div class="security"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/security/sterling-products-limited/">spl</a></div><div class="closing">841.5</div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="feature background group" style="background:url(https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/gse/sec/media/Capture-2.png) no-repeat center 50%; background-size:cover;"><div class="overlay"><div class="wrapper"><div class="content"><h1><div class="title">Republic Bank (Guyana) Limited</div></h1></div></div></div></div> <main id="main" class="site-main wrapper group" role="main"><div class="sidebar col span-3"><div class="feed"><div class="bulletins"><h3>Bulletins</h3><div class="bulletin"><div class="info group"><div class="title"><a href="#26515" class="inline-popup">Republic Bank (Guyana) Limited (RBL) &#8211; pays $3.40 per share Interim Dividend 2026</a></div><div id="26515" class="mfp-hide popup-content" ><p>The Board of Directors of Republic Bank (Guyana) Limited met on April 20, 2026 and approved the payment of an Interim Dividend of $3.40 per share. Dividends are payable on May 22, 2026 and will be paid to shareholders registered as at the close of business on May 22, 2026.</p></div><span class ="number 219"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/bulletin-number/219/">Bulletin 219</a></span><span class="date">April 2026</span></div></div><div class="bulletin"><div class="info group"><div class="title"><a href="#25638" class="inline-popup">Republic Bank (Guyana) Limited (RBL) &#8211; Annual General Meeting and Final Dividend of $9.75 for 2025</a></div><div id="25638" class="mfp-hide popup-content" ><p>The Board of Directors at their meeting held on October 27, 2025, resolved that the 41st Annual General Meeting of Republic Bank (Guyana) Limited will be held on December 8, 2025.  The Board of Directors recommended a Final Dividend of $9.75 per share for the year ended 30th September 2025, subject to stockholders approval.</p></div><span class ="number 215"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/bulletin-number/215/">Bulletin 215</a></span><span class="date">October 2025</span></div></div><div class="bulletin"><div class="info group"><div class="title"><a href="#25166" class="inline-popup">Republic Bank (Guyana) Limited (RBL) &#8211; pays $3.00 per share Interim Dividend 2025</a></div><div id="25166" class="mfp-hide popup-content" ><p>The Board of Directors of Republic Bank (Guyana) Limited met on April 25, 2025 and approved the payment of an Interim Dividend of $3.00 per share. Dividends are payable on May 27, 2025 and will be paid to shareholders registered as at the close of business on May 23, 2025.</p></div><span class ="number 212"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/bulletin-number/212/">Bulletin 212</a></span><span class="date">April 2025</span></div></div><div class="bulletin"><div class="info group"><div class="title"><a href="#24051" class="inline-popup">Republic Bank (Guyana) Limited (RBL) &#8211; Annual General Meeting and Final Dividend of $8.50 for 2024</a></div><div id="24051" class="mfp-hide popup-content" ><p>The Board of Directors at their meeting held on October 21, 2024, resolved that the 40th Annual General Meeting of Republic Bank (Guyana) Limited will be held on December 9, 2024.  The Board of Directors recommended a Final Dividend of $8.50 per share for the year ended 30th September 2024, subject to stockholders approval.</p></div><span class ="number 208"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/bulletin-number/208/">Bulletin 208</a></span><span class="date">October 2024</span></div></div><div class="bulletin"><div class="info group"><div class="title"><a href="#24173" class="inline-popup">Republic Bank (Guyana) Limited (RBL) &#8211; pays $2.42 per share Interim Dividend 2024</a></div><div id="24173" class="mfp-hide popup-content" ><p>The Board of Directors of Republic Bank (Guyana) Limited met on April 22, 2024 and approved the payment of an Interim Dividend of $2.42 per share. Dividends are payable on May 24, 2024 and will be paid to shareholders registered as at the close of business on May 24, 2024.</p></div><span class ="number 204"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/bulletin-number/204/">Bulletin 204</a></span><span class="date">April 2024</span></div></div><div class="bulletin"><div class="info group"><div class="title"><a href="#22142" class="inline-popup">Republic Bank (Guyana) Limited (RBL) &#8211; Annual General Meeting and Final Dividend of $5.25 for 2023</a></div><div id="22142" class="mfp-hide popup-content" ><p>The Board of Directors at their meeting held on October 23, 2023, resolved that the 39th Annual General Meeting of Republic Bank (Guyana) Limited will be held on December 12, 2023.  The Board of Directors recommended a Final Dividend of $5.25 per share for the year ended 30th September 2023, subject to stockholders approval.</p></div><span class ="number 200"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/bulletin-number/200/">Bulletin 200</a></span><span class="date">October 2023</span></div></div><div class="bulletin"><div class="info group"><div class="title"><a href="#21111" class="inline-popup">Republic Bank (Guyana) Limited (RBL) &#8211; pays $1.75 per share Interim Dividend 2023</a></div><div id="21111" class="mfp-hide popup-content" ><p>The Board of Directors of Republic Bank (Guyana) Limited met on April 24, 2023 and approved the payment of an Interim Dividend of $1.75 per share. Dividends are payable on May 22, 2023 and will be paid to shareholders registered as at the close of business on May 08, 2023.</p></div><span class ="number 194"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/bulletin-number/194/">Bulletin 194</a></span><span class="date">April 2023</span></div></div><div class="bulletin"><div class="info group"><div class="title"><a href="#20229" class="inline-popup">Republic Bank (Guyana) Limited (RBL) &#8211; Annual General Meeting and Final Dividend of $4.00 for 2022</a></div><div id="20229" class="mfp-hide popup-content" ><p>The Board of Directors at their meeting held on October 25, 2022, resolved that the 38th Annual General Meeting of Republic Bank (Guyana) Limited will be held on December 9, 2022.  The Board of Directors recommended a Final Dividend of $4.00 per share for the year ended 30th September 2022, subject to stockholders approval.</p></div><span class ="number 189"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/bulletin-number/189/">Bulletin 189</a></span><span class="date">October 2022</span></div></div><div class="bulletin"><div class="info group"><div class="title"><a href="#19499" class="inline-popup">Republic Bank (Guyana) Limited (RBL) &#8211; pays $1.40 per share Interim Dividend 2022</a></div><div id="19499" class="mfp-hide popup-content" ><p>The Board of Directors of Republic Bank (Guyana) Limited met on April 25, 2022 and approved the payment of an Interim Dividend of $1.40 per share. Dividends are payable on May 23, 2022 and will be paid to shareholders registered as at the close of business on May 09, 2022.</p></div><span class ="number 185"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/bulletin-number/185/">Bulletin 185</a></span><span class="date">April 2022</span></div></div><div class="bulletin"><div class="info group"><div class="title"><a href="#18270" class="inline-popup">Republic Bank (Guyana) Limited (RBL) &#8211; Annual General Meeting and Final Dividend of $3.50 for 2021</a></div><div id="18270" class="mfp-hide popup-content" ><p>The Board of Directors at their meeting held on October 25, 2021, resolved that the 37th Annual General Meeting of Republic Bank (Guyana) Limited will be held on December 14, 2021.  The Board of Directors recommended a Final Dividend of $3.50 per share for the year ended 30th September 2021, subject to stockholders approval.</p></div><span class ="number 181"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/bulletin-number/181/">Bulletin 181</a></span><span class="date">November 2021</span></div></div><div class="bulletin"><div class="info group"><div class="title"><a href="#17322" class="inline-popup">Republic Bank (Guyana) Limited (RBL) &#8211; pays $1.00 per share Interim Dividend 2021</a></div><div id="17322" class="mfp-hide popup-content" ><p><span lang="EN-GB">The Board of Directors of Republic Bank (Guyana) Limited </span><span lang="EN-GB">met on April 19, 2021 and </span><span lang="EN-GB">approved the payment of an </span>I<span lang="EN-GB">nterim Dividend </span>of <span lang="EN-GB">$1.00 per share. Dividends are payable on May 14, 2021 and will be paid to shareholders registered as at the close of business on May 06, 2021.</span></p></div><span class="date">April 2021</span></div></div><div class="bulletin"><div class="info group"><div class="title"><a href="#16311" class="inline-popup">Republic Bank (Guyana) Limited (RBL) &#8211; Annual General Meeting and Final Dividend of $3.25 for 2020</a></div><div id="16311" class="mfp-hide popup-content" ><p>The Board of Directors at their meeting held on October 19, 2020, resolved that the 36th Annual General Meeting of Republic Bank (Guyana) Limited will be held on December 7, 2020.  The Board of Directors recommended a Final Dividend of $3.25 per share for the year ended 30th September 2020, subject to stockholders approval.</p></div><span class ="number 170"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/bulletin-number/170/">Bulletin 170</a></span><span class="date">October 2020</span></div></div><div class="bulletin"><div class="info group"><div class="title"><a href="#13157" class="inline-popup">Republic Bank (Guyana) Limited (RBL) &#8211; Annual General Meeting and Final Dividend of $3.58 for 2019</a></div><div id="13157" class="mfp-hide popup-content" ><p>The Board of Directors at their meeting held October 21, 2019, resolved that the 35th Annual General Meeting of Republic Bank (Guyana) Limited will be held on December 9, 2019.  The Board of Directors recommended a Final Dividend of $3.58 per share for the year ended 30th September 2019, subject to stockholders approval.</p></div><span class ="number 161"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/bulletin-number/161/">Bulletin 161</a></span><span class="date">October 2019</span></div></div></div></div></div><div id="primary" class="content-area col span-9"><h2> Financials</h2><div class="carousel financials financial-nav"><div class="slide" id="2026">2026</div><div class="slide" id="2025">2025</div><div class="slide" id="2024">2024</div><div class="slide" id="2023">2023</div><div class="slide" id="2022">2022</div><div class="slide" id="2021">2021</div><div class="slide" id="2020">2020</div><div class="slide" id="2019">2019</div><div class="slide" id="2018">2018</div></div><div class="small">-->Select Year</div><div class="slider financials financial-years"><div class="year slide" id="2026"><h3>2026</h3><div class="fin-data"><table class="financial-session"><thead><tr><th class="session">Session</th><th class="date">Session Date</th><th class="mnemonic">Last Trade Price(G$)</th><th class="name">EPS (G$)</th><th class="best bid">P/E Ratio</th><th class="vol bid">Dividends paid in last 12 monts (G$)</th><th class="best offer">Dividen